              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho Aiziraeli aolaga Amoabu elufu kumi ariokala masujaa na enye mkpwotse, wala takuna hata mmwenga yeweza kuchimbira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
